<div class="mandarin-hanzi">对不起</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">duìbuqǐ</div>

''Meaning:'' sorry; excuse me  
''Part of speech:'' interjection

!! In context
对不起，我来晚了。 — Duìbuqǐ, wǒ lái wǎn le. — Sorry, I arrived late.

!! Usage note
The 不 is often neutral in this fixed expression.
